Regression test for RUST_LOG="" (set-but-empty) vs. unset — see
`resolve_filter_source` in `src/main.rs`. `upload` fails on a file that does
not exist before any network call, so nothing is read or sent; the INFO lines
are logged before it does.

```
$ RUST_LOG= jci-coverage upload --file /no/such/file --repo-token x
? 1
[..]INFO jci_coverage::upload: upload [..]
[..]INFO jci_coverage::upload: upload token repo_token=provided via --repo-token (value withheld)
Error: coverage file not found: /no/such/file [..]

```
